    "en": {
      "trackName": "Sky Kid",
      "description": "nspired by the legendary Sky Kid arcade game, this Apple Watch adaptation delivers fast, nostalgic side-scrolling action designed specifically for the small screen. Take control of your tiny propeller plane, fly through colorful pixel-art skies, and dodge terrain and obstacles as the world scrolls beneath you.\n\nUse the Digital Crown to smoothly control your movement, just like an arcade stick reimagined for watchOS. The parallax backgrounds give depth to the world, while crisp, pixel-perfect graphics stay true to the original retro style.\n\nBuilt from the ground up for Apple Watch, Sky Kid – Watch Edition is quick to pick up, easy to play in short bursts, and perfect for classic arcade fans.\n\nFeatures\n\nAuthentic retro arcade gameplay inspired by Sky Kid\n\nSmooth Digital Crown controls\n\nPixel-perfect graphics with layered parallax scrolling\n\nOptimized for Apple Watch screens and quick play sessions\n\nA love letter to classic arcade aviation games\n\nRelive the golden age of arcades — now on your wrist.",
